    "canonical_ref": "PL59.AD.11.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": ": V nus Dominus, una fides, unum baptisma ( Ephes. IV, 5). Quis præsumat contra vas electionis unitatem istam pluralitate confundere ?",
